Looking further, the code processes the values. The value from values_values(idx) is checked to be >=0 and within maxlength_ if applicable. Then, it updates per_batch_counts[batch][value]. The problem here is that 'value' could be a very large number, leading to an out-of-bounds access in the per_batch_counts array. 

