So if remain is up to 4 (since remain <5), then ctx->bytes_in_header can be up to 4. So 8 - ctx->bytes_in_header would be 4, which is okay. But if somehow remain is larger than 5, but the code only does this when remain <5. Wait, the code that leads to this is in the while loop's first part:

